# What `mapps code:push` leaves out of the upload.
#
# The CLI uses this file *instead of* .gitignore when it exists, and it finds
# .gitignore with a `**/.gitignore` glob that takes the first match — which can
# be one inside a dependency. node_modules, .git, .env and
# local-secure-storage.db.json are always excluded by the CLI itself.
#
# Only literal paths that exist work: each line is kept only if
# `fs.existsSync(directory + line)` is true, so wildcards are silently dropped
# (monday-apps-cli, src/services/files-service.ts, read 27 Sep 2026).

# Rebuilt by `npm start` on the server; a stale copy would hide a broken build.
dist/

# Not needed to run.
test/
listing/
